DSP56300 JIT: handle returns at DO loop boundaries
Based on xemu-project/dsp56300 b36db2c (tools/native/linux-deps.json).
Applied by tools/native/dsp-jit-source.py.

When a DO loop ends with a subroutine call, returning to LA+1 must
complete the iteration. The JIT only checked fall-through, leaving
the loop stack active and causing broken audio or shutdown hangs.

Mark RTS/RTI returns in compiled and stepped execution. Regression
tests cover JSR and BSR calls at the end of a DO loop.

